    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "みどりのひふは　みずにも　つよい。 むかし　ほかのとちから　やってきて ひとと　いっしょに　はたらいた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa peau verte résiste bien à l’eau. Il s’est installé dans la région il y a longtemps et a travaillé en coopération avec les Hommes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They came over from another region long ago and worked together with humans. Their green skin is resistant to water.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "緑の皮膚は　水にも　強い。 昔　ほかの土地から　やってきて 人と　いっしょに　働いた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "むれを　つくって　くらしている。 はなの　あくりょくは　おおいわも こなごなに　くだくほど　つよい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ces Pokémon vivent en troupeau. L’étreinte de leur trompe est si forte qu’elle suffit à réduire un rocher en poussière.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have incredible grip strength, strong enough to crush giant rocks into powder.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "群れを　つくって　暮らしている。 鼻の　握力は　大岩も 粉々に　砕くほど　強い。",
        "language": {
